format\\\" = \\\"markdown\\\"\\n10:     \\\"body\\\" = \\\"# Angular AI Component Generator - Requirements Document\\n11: \\n12: ## 1. Executive Summary\\n13: \\n14: This document outlines the requirements for building an Angular AI Component Generator - a tool that uses AI to automatically generate Angular components based on natural language descriptions or design inputs.\\n15: \\n16: ## 2. Problem Statement\\n17: \\n18: - Developers spend significant time writing repetitive Angular boilerplate code\\n19: - Manual component creation is error-prone and time-consuming\\n20: - Need for consistent, production-ready Angular components following best practices\\n21: \\n22: ## 3. Target Users\\n23: \\n24: - Frontend Angular developers\\n25: - Full-stack developers working with Angular\\n26: - Development teams wanting to accelerate Angular development\\n27: \\n28: ## 4. Existing Tools Analysis\\n29: \\n30: ### 4.1 Claude Code ( Anthropic )\\n31: - **Type**: AI coding assistant with CLI\\n32: - **Strengths**: Context-aware code generation, sub-agent task delegation, persistent memory\\n33: - **Angular Support**: Yes, via natural language prompts\\n34: \\n35: ### 4.2 Kendo UI AI Assistant (Telerik)\\n36: - **Type**: MCP Server + Agent for Angular\\n37: - **Strengths**: Grounded in Kendo UI docs, agentic UI generation\\n38: - **Output**: Production-ready Kendo UI components\\n39: \\n40: ### 4.3 PureCode AI\\n41: - **Type**: VS Code extension\\n42: - **Strengths**: Context-aware using codebase, custom component generation\\n43: - **Output**: 50% faster component creation\\n44: \\n45: ### 4.4 Workik AI\\n46: - **Type**: Online AI code generator\\n47: - **Strengths**: Free, multi-language support\\n48: - **Angular Support**: Yes, online generator\\n49: \\n50: ### 4.5 Kigumi\\n51: - **Type**: Framework wrapper generator\\n52: - **Strengths**: Idiomatic wrappers for Web Awesome components\\n53: \\n54: ## 5. Feature Requirements\\n55: \\n56: ### 5.1 Core Features (Must Have)\\n57: \\n58: | Feature | Description | Priority |\\n59: |---------|-------------|----------|\\n60: | Natural Language Input | Generate components from text descriptions | Critical |\\n61: | Component Type Selection | Support for: Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module | Critical |\\n62: | Template Generation | Generate .html templates with proper Angular syntax | Critical |\\n63: | TypeScript Support | Full TypeScript with proper typing | Critical |\\n64: | SCSS/CSS Generation | Component styling with SCSS | Critical |\\n65: | OnPush Change Detection | Default to OnPush strategy | High |\\n66: | Dependency Injection | Proper Injectable service pattern | High |\\n67: | Input/Output Decorators | Auto-generate @Input/@Output | High |\\n68: \\n69: ### 5.2 Advanced Features (Should Have)\\n70: \\n71: | Feature | Description | Priority |\\n72: |---------|-------------|----------|\\n73: | File Structure Generation | Create folder structure with index.ts, .spec.ts | Medium |\\n74: | Kendo UI Integration | Generate Kendo UI components | Medium |\\n75: | Ng-Zorro Integration | Generate Ant Design Angular components | Medium |\\n76: | Testing Boilerplate | Generate .spec.ts with basic tests | Medium |\\n77: | Routing Support | Generate routed components with children | Low |\\n78: \\n79: ### 5.3 Technical Approach Options\\n80: \\n81: **Option A: CLI-based Agent**\\n82: - Integrates with Claude Code / Cursor\\n83: - Uses natural language prompts\\n84: - Pros: Easy to implement, flexible\\n85: - Cons: Depends on external AI\\n86: \\n87: **Option B: MCP Server (Kendo UI style)**\\n88: - Custom MCP server for Angular\\n89: - Grounded in Angular best practices\\n90: - Pros: Specialized, consistent output\\n91: - Cons: Requires MCP setup\\n92: \\n93: **Option C: VS Code Extension**\\n94: - Embed AI generation directly in IDE\\n95: - Context-aware using workspace\\n96: - Pros: Tight integration, offline capable\\n97: - Cons: Complex development\\n98: \\n99: ## 6. Recommended Approach\\n100: \\n101: **Recommended**: Option A (CLI-based Agent) with Option B enhancements\\n102: \\n103: - Start with Claude Code integration for natural language input\\n104: - Add custom prompt templates for Angular-specific patterns\\n105: - Generate output following EMS Finance / Angular 12 conventions\\n106: - Support Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro component libraries\\n107: \\n108: ## 7. Technical Stack Recommendations\\n109: \\n110: - **AI Provider**: Claude Code 2.5 (latest with sub-agent support)\\n111: - **Output Format**: Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing\\n112: - **UI Libraries**: Kendo UI, Ng-Zorro (Ant Design)\\n113: - **Architecture**: 4-layer (data-access/service/feature/ui)\\n114: \\n115: ## 8. Success Metrics\\n116: \\n117: - Reduce component creation time by 70%\\n118: - Generate production-ready code with 0 lint errors\\n119: - Support all major Angular component types\\n120: - Integrate with existing Angular best practices\\n121: \\n122: ## 9. Next Steps\\n123: \\n124: 1. Create prototype with Claude Code integration\\n125: 2. Define Angular-specific prompt templates\\n126: 3. Test with real-world component generation\\n127: 4. Iterate based on developer feedback\\n128: 5. Add Kendo UI / Ng-Zorro support\\n129: \\n130: ---\\n131: *Research completed by: GitHub Manager*\\n132: *Date: 2026-03-31*\\\"\\n133:     \\\"baseRevisionId\\\" = $null\\n134: } | ConvertTo-Json\\n135: \\n136: $response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri \\\"$env:PAPERCLIP_API_URL/api/issues/92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3/documents/requirements\\\" -Headers $headers -Method Put -Body $body\\n137: $response | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10\\n\\n(End of file - total 137 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"$headers = @{\\n    \\\"Authorization\\\" = \\\"Bearer $env:PAPERCLIP_API_KEY\\\"\\n    \\\"X-Paperclip-Run-Id\\\" = $env:PAPERCLIP_RUN_ID\\n    \\\"Content-Type\\\" = \\\"application/json\\\"\\n}\\n\\n$body = @{\\n    \\\"title\\\" = \\\"Requirements\\\"\\n    \\\"format\\\" = \\\"markdown\\\"\\n    \\\"body\\\" = \\\"# Angular AI Component Generator - Requirements Document\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\n\\nThis document outlines the requirements for building an Angular AI Component Generator - a tool that uses AI to automatically generate Angular components based on natural language descriptions or design inputs.\\n\\n## 2. Problem Statement\\n\\n- Developers spend significant time writing repetitive Angular boilerplate code\\n- Manual component creation is error-prone and time-consuming\\n- Need for consistent, production-ready Angular components following best practices\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[]},\"title\":\"Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\doc_put.ps1\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774940718873,\"end\":1774940718883}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774940718928,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b6074c001zREG1rUabZ9T4n\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b5d46f001WyiQ2Xbgem0MOh\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":37674,\"input\":296,\"output\":130,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":37248}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774940747979,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b678c5001VFt2keXaYD2Fqx\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b60751001u8iQ0diEI1P7SD\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774940750718,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b678c9001QhQ6PX55Yo7zkA\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b60751001u8iQ0diEI1P7SD\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"bash\",\"callID\":\"call_function_l7n45cf2qk4a_1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\doc_put.ps1\\\"\",\"description\":\"Create requirements document\"},\"output\":\"{\\r\\n    \\\"id\\\":  \\\"503bbd15-df94-4468-b21b-47e8e826dfde\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"companyId\\\":  \\\"c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"issueId\\\":  \\\"92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"key\\\":  \\\"requirements\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"title\\\":  \\\"Requirements\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"format\\\":  \\\"markdown\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"body\\\":  \\\"# Angular AI Component Generator - Requirements Document\\\\n\\\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\\\n\\\\nThis document outlines the requirements for building an Angular AI Component Generator - a tool that uses AI to automatically generate Angular components based on natural language descriptions or design inputs.\\\\n\\\\n## 2. Problem Statement\\\\n\\\\n- Developers spend significant time writing repetitive Angular boilerplate code\\\\n- Manual component creation is error-prone and time-consuming\\\\n- Need for consistent, production-ready Angular components following best practices\\\\n\\\\n## 3. Target Users\\\\n\\\\n- Frontend Angular developers\\\\n- Full-stack developers working with Angular\\\\n- Development teams wanting to accelerate Angular development\\\\n\\\\n## 4. Existing Tools Analysis\\\\n\\\\n### 4.1 Claude Code ( Anthropic )\\\\n- **Type**: AI coding assistant with CLI\\\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware code generation, sub-agent task delegation, persistent memory\\\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, via natural language prompts\\\\n\\\\n### 4.2 Kendo UI AI Assistant (Telerik)\\\\n- **Type**: MCP Server + Agent for Angular\\\\n- **Strengths**: Grounded in Kendo UI docs, agentic UI generation\\\\n- **Output**: Production-ready Kendo UI components\\\\n\\\\n### 4.3 PureCode AI\\\\n- **Type**: VS Code extension\\\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware using codebase, custom component generation\\\\n- **Output**: 50% faster component creation\\\\n\\\\n### 4.4 Workik AI\\\\n- **Type**: Online AI code generator\\\\n- **Strengths**: Free, multi-language support\\\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, online generator\\\\n\\\\n### 4.5 Kigumi\\\\n- **Type**: Framework wrapper generator\\\\n- **Strengths**: Idiomatic wrappers for Web Awesome components\\\\n\\\\n## 5. Feature Requirements\\\\n\\\\n### 5.1 Core Features (Must Have)\\\\n\\\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\\\n| Natural Language Input | Generate components from text descriptions | Critical |\\\\n| Component Type Selection | Support for: Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module | Critical |\\\\n| Template Generation | Generate .html templates with proper Angular syntax | Critical |\\\\n| TypeScript Support | Full TypeScript with proper typing | Critical |\\\\n| SCSS/CSS Generation | Component styling with SCSS | Critical |\\\\n| OnPush Change Detection | Default to OnPush strategy | High |\\\\n| Dependency Injection | Proper Injectable service pattern | High |\\\\n| Input/Output Decorators | Auto-generate @Input/@Output | High |\\\\n\\\\n### 5.2 Advanced Features (Should Have)\\\\n\\\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\\\n| File Structure Generation | Create folder structure with index.ts, .spec.ts | Medium |\\\\n| Kendo UI Integration | Generate Kendo UI components | Medium |\\\\n| Ng-Zorro Integration | Generate Ant Design Angular components | Medium |\\\\n| Testing Boilerplate | Generate .spec.ts with basic tests | Medium |\\\\n| Routing Support | Generate routed components with children | Low |\\\\n\\\\n### 5.3 Technical Approach Options\\\\n\\\\n**Option A: CLI-based Agent**\\\\n- Integrates with Claude Code / Cursor\\\\n- Uses natural language prompts\\\\n- Pros: Easy to implement, flexible\\\\n- Cons: Depends on external AI\\\\n\\\\n**Option B: MCP Server (Kendo UI style)**\\\\n- Custom MCP server for Angular\\\\n- Grounded in Angular best practices\\\\n- Pros: Specialized, consistent output\\\\n- Cons: Requires MCP setup\\\\n\\\\n**Option C: VS Code Extension**\\\\n- Embed AI generation directly in IDE\\\\n- Context-aware using workspace\\\\n- Pros: Tight integration, offline capable\\\\n- Cons: Complex development\\\\n\\\\n## 6. Recommended Approach\\\\n\\\\n**Recommended**: Option A (CLI-based Agent) with Option B enhancements\\\\n\\\\n- Start with Claude Code integration for natural language input\\\\n- Add custom prompt templates for Angular-specific patterns\\\\n- Generate output following EMS Finance / Angular 12 conventions\\\\n- Support Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro component libraries\\\\n\\\\n## 7. Technical Stack Recommendations\\\\n\\\\n- **AI Provider**: Claude Code 2.5 (latest with sub-agent support)\\\\n- **Output Format**: Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing\\\\n- **UI Libraries**: Kendo UI, Ng-Zorro (Ant Design)\\\\n- **Architecture**: 4-layer (data-access/service/feature/ui)\\\\n\\\\n## 8. Success Metrics\\\\n\\\\n- Reduce component creation time by 70%\\\\n- Generate production-ready code with 0 lint errors\\\\n- Support all major Angular component types\\\\n- Integrate with existing Angular best practices\\\\n\\\\n## 9. Next Steps\\\\n\\\\n1. Create prototype with Claude Code integration\\\\n2. Define Angular-specific prompt templates\\\\n3. Test with real-world component generation\\\\n4. Iterate based on developer feedback\\\\n5. Add Kendo UI / Ng-Zorro support\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n*Research completed by: GitHub Manager*\\\\n*Date: 2026-03-31*\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionId\\\":  \\\"f57d2871-8542-41c3-8d79-d67ca226263c\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionNumber\\\":  1,\\r\\n    \\\"createdByAgentId\\\":  \\\"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"createdByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByAgentId\\\":  \\\"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"createdAt\\\":  \\\"2026-03-31T07:05:50.509Z\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"updatedAt\\\":  \\\"2026-03-31T07:05:50.509Z\\\"\\r\\n}\\r\\n\",\"metadata\":{\"output\":\"{\\r\\n    \\\"id\\\":  \\\"503bbd15-df94-4468-b21b-47e8e826dfde\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"companyId\\\":  \\\"c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"issueId\\\":  \\\"92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"key\\\":  \\\"requirements\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"title\\\":  \\\"Requirements\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"format\\\":  \\\"markdown\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"body\\\":  \\\"# Angular AI Component Generator - Requirements Document\\\\n\\\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\\\n\\\\nThis document outlines the requirements for building an Angular AI Component Generator - a tool that uses AI to automatically generate Angular components based on natural language descriptions or design inputs.\\\\n\\\\n## 2. Problem Statement\\\\n\\\\n- Developers spend significant time writing repetitive Angular boilerplate code\\\\n- Manual component creation is error-prone and time-consuming\\\\n- Need for consistent, production-ready Angular components following best practices\\\\n\\\\n## 3. Target Users\\\\n\\\\n- Frontend Angular developers\\\\n- Full-stack developers working with Angular\\\\n- Development teams wanting to accelerate Angular development\\\\n\\\\n## 4. Existing Tools Analysis\\\\n\\\\n### 4.1 Claude Code ( Anthropic )\\\\n- **Type**: AI coding assistant with CLI\\\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware code generation, sub-agent task delegation, persistent memory\\\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, via natural language prompts\\\\n\\\\n### 4.2 Kendo UI AI Assistant (Telerik)\\\\n- **Type**: MCP Server + Agent for Angular\\\\n- **Strengths**: Grounded in Kendo UI docs, agentic UI generation\\\\n- **Output**: Production-ready Kendo UI components\\\\n\\\\n### 4.3 PureCode AI\\\\n- **Type**: VS Code extension\\\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware using codebase, custom component generation\\\\n- **Output**: 50% faster component creation\\\\n\\\\n### 4.4 Workik AI\\\\n- **Type**: Online AI code generator\\\\n- **Strengths**: Free, multi-language support\\\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, online generator\\\\n\\\\n### 4.5 Kigumi\\\\n- **Type**: Framework wrapper generator\\\\n- **Strengths**: Idiomatic wrappers for Web Awesome components\\\\n\\\\n## 5. Feature Requirements\\\\n\\\\n### 5.1 Core Features (Must Have)\\\\n\\\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\\\n| Natural Language Input | Generate components from text descriptions | Critical |\\\\n| Component Type Selection | Support for: Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module | Critical |\\\\n| Template Generation | Generate .html templates with proper Angular syntax | Critical |\\\\n| TypeScript Support | Full TypeScript with proper typing | Critical |\\\\n| SCSS/CSS Generation | Component styling with SCSS | Critical |\\\\n| OnPush Change Detection | Default to OnPush strategy | High |\\\\n| Dependency Injection | Proper Injectable service pattern | High |\\\\n| Input/Output Decorators | Auto-generate @Input/@Output | High |\\\\n\\\\n### 5.2 Advanced Features (Should Have)\\\\n\\\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\\\n| File Structure Generation | Create folder structure with index.ts, .spec.ts | Medium |\\\\n| Kendo UI Integration | Generate Kendo UI components | Medium |\\\\n| Ng-Zorro Integration | Generate Ant Design Angular components | Medium |\\\\n| Testing Boilerplate | Generate .spec.ts with basic tests | Medium |\\\\n| Routing Support | Generate routed components with children | Low |\\\\n\\\\n### 5.3 Technical Approach Options\\\\n\\\\n**Option A: CLI-based Agent**\\\\n- Integrates with Claude Code / Cursor\\\\n- Uses natural language prompts\\\\n- Pros: Easy to implement, flexible\\\\n- Cons: Depends on external AI\\\\n\\\\n**Option B: MCP Server (Kendo UI style)**\\\\n- Custom MCP server for Angular\\\\n- Grounded in Angular best practices\\\\n- Pros: Specialized, consistent output\\\\n- Cons: Requires MCP setup\\\\n\\\\n**Option C: VS Code Extension**\\\\n- Embed AI generation directly in IDE\\\\n- Context-aware using workspace\\\\n- Pros: Tight integration, offline capable\\\\n- Cons: Complex development\\\\n\\\\n## 6. Recommended Approach\\\\n\\\\n**Recommended**: Option A (CLI-based Agent) with Option B enhancements\\\\n\\\\n- Start with Claude Code integration for natural language input\\\\n- Add custom prompt templates for Angular-specific patterns\\\\n- Generate output following EMS Finance / Angular 12 conventions\\\\n- Support Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro component libraries\\\\n\\\\n## 7. Technical Stack Recommendations\\\\n\\\\n- **AI Provider**: Claude Code 2.5 (latest with sub-agent support)\\\\n- **Output Format**: Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing\\\\n- **UI Libraries**: Kendo UI, Ng-Zorro (Ant Design)\\\\n- **Architecture**: 4-layer (data-access/service/feature/ui)\\\\n\\\\n## 8. Success Metrics\\\\n\\\\n- Reduce component creation time by 70%\\\\n- Generate production-ready code with 0 lint errors\\\\n- Support all major Angular component types\\\\n- Integrate with existing Angular best practices\\\\n\\\\n## 9. Next Steps\\\\n\\\\n1. Create prototype with Claude Code integration\\\\n2. Define Angular-specific prompt templates\\\\n3. Test with real-world component generation\\\\n4. Iterate based on developer feedback\\\\n5. Add Kendo UI / Ng-Zorro support\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n*Research completed by: GitHub Manager*\\\\n*Date: 2026-03-31*\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionId\\\":  \\\"f57d2871-8542-41c3-8d79-d67ca226263c\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionNumber\\\":  1,\\r\\n    \\\"createdByAgentId\\\":  \\\"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"createdByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByAgentId\\\":  \\\"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"createdAt\\\