{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1774940779142,"sessionID":"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa","part":{"id":"prt_d42b6f279001Bkn1OERKdWVdAA","messageID":"msg_d42b6837e001NFNWxwHngyfCz7","sessionID":"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa","type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_function_xrb8g5oz1vuh_1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"$headers = @{\n    \"Authorization\" = \"Bearer $env:PAPERCLIP_API_KEY\"\n    \"X-Paperclip-Run-Id\" = $env:PAPERCLIP_RUN_ID\n    \"Content-Type\" = \"application/json\"\n}\n\n$body = @{\n    \"status\" = \"done\"\n    \"comment\" = \"## Research Complete\n\nResearched AI code generation tools for Angular component generation and created requirements document.\n\n### Tools Analyzed\n- Claude Code 2.5 - AI coding assistant with sub-agent support\n- Kendo UI AI Assistant - MCP server for Angular\n- PureCode AI - VS Code extension\n- Workik AI - Online generator\n- Kigumi - Framework wrapper generator\n\n### Key Requirements\n- Natural language input for component generation\n- Support for Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module\n- Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing\n- Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro integration\n- 4-layer architecture (data-access/service/feature/ui)\n\n### Recommended Approach\nCLI-based Agent with custom Angular prompt templates, starting with Claude Code integration.\n\n### Document\nFull requirements saved to: [SELAA-10](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-10#document-requirements)\"\n} | ConvertTo-Json\n\n$response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri \"$env:PAPERCLIP_API_URL/api/issues/92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3\" -Headers $headers -Method Patch -Body $body\n$response | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10","filePath":"C:\\Users\\THANHSANG\\.paperclip\\instances\\default\\projects\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\_default\\update_done.ps1"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"C:\\Users\\THANHSANG\\.paperclip\\instances\\default\\projects\\c8285903-c70f-45