essionID\":\"ses_2bd33aa09ffeNZNpM8y0BK8P3h\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42ccd8cf001Cjjx0uSVOg7ZN8\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42ccc8a6001SnxeO1ajlQErwZ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd33aa09ffeNZNpM8y0BK8P3h\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774942214370,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd33aa09ffeNZNpM8y0BK8P3h\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42ccd8d2002Zipbe9iNbJp42E\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42ccc8a6001SnxeO1ajlQErwZ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd33aa09ffeNZNpM8y0BK8P3h\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_function_76u7h35i5lma_1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\linkedin-post-day1.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\linkedin-post-day1.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>1: # LinkedIn Post - Day 1\\n2: \\n3: ## Post Draft\\n4: \\n5: ---\\n6: \\n7: **I learned Angular before there was a \\\"Senior\\\" title for it.**\\n8: \\n9: 7 years ago, I started coding from my bedroom. No CS degree. No bootcamp. No mentor.\\n10: \\n11: Just a laptop, free tutorials, and stubbornness.\\n12: \\n13: Today? I'm a Senior Dev working with Angular and .NET daily.\\n14: \\n15: Here's what nobody told me:\\n16: \\n17: 1. **\\\"Self-taught\\\" is not a limitation. It's an advantage.**\\n18:    I learned how to learn. That's a skill most CS grads never develop.\\n19: \\n20: 2. **The first year is the hardest.**\\n21:    I wrote code that makes me cringe today. But I wrote code. Every. Single. Day.\\n22: \\n23: 3. **Degrees don't make developers. Projects do.**\\n24:    My first \\\"real\\\" job came from a portfolio of side projects, not my resume.\\n25: \\n26: If you're where I was 7 years ago - uncertain, self-doubting, wondering if you \\\"belong\\\" in tech:\\n27: \\n28: You belong.\\n29: \\n30: The only thing that separates senior devs from junior devs is time + practice. That's it.\\n31: \\n32: What was your \\\"day 1\\\" moment in tech? 👇\\n33: \\n34: ---\\n35: \\n36: _#SoftwareDeveloper #SelfTaught #Angular #NET #CareerJourney #TechCareers_\\n\\n(End of file - total 36 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"# LinkedIn Post - Day 1\\n\\n## Post Draft\\n\\n---\\n\\n**I learned Angular before there was a \\\"Senior\\\" title for it.**\\n\\n7 years ago, I started coding from my bedroom. No CS degree. No bootcamp. No mentor.\\n\\nJust a laptop, free tutorials, and stubbornness.\\n\\nToday? I'm a Senior Dev working with Angular and .NET daily.\\n\\nHere's what nobody told me:\\n\\n1. **\\\"Self-taught\\\" is not a limitation. It's an advantage.**\\n   I learned how to learn. That's a skill most CS grads never develop.\\n\\n2. **The first year is the hardest.**\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[]},\"title\":\"Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\linkedin-post-day1.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774942214355,\"end\":1774942214369}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774942214394,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd33aa09ffeNZNpM8y0BK8P3h\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42ccd8d4001nvaWOu6MIRpFEw\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42ccc8a6001SnxeO1ajlQErwZ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd33aa09ffeNZNpM8y0BK8P3h\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_function_76u7h35i5lma_2\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\plan.json\"},\"output\":\"<path>C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\plan.json</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>1: {\\n2:   \\\"title\\\": \\\"Brand Strategy & Content Plan\\\",\\n3:   \\\"format\\\": \\\"markdown\\\",\\n4:   \\\"body\\\": \\\"# Self-Taught Labs - Brand Strategy & 30-Day Content Plan\\\\n\\\\n## Company Mission\\\\n**Self-Taught Labs** is a personal brand studio for a self-taught Senior Developer with 7+ years of experience in Angular/.NET who builds open-source AI tools.\\\\n\\\\n## Strategic Goals (Next 90 Days)\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 1: LinkedIn Growth\\\\n- Target: 500+ followers in 90 days\\\\n- Strategy: Position as expert Angular/.NET developer who self-taught AI/ML\\\\n- Content mix: 60% technical, 30% personal brand, 10% industry commentary\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 2: Open-Source AI Tool v1\\\\n- Target: Ship first open-source AI tool\\\\n- Tech stack: Angular + .NET + AI integration\\\\n- Focus: Solve a real problem for Angular/.NET developers\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 3: Content Production\\\\n- Target: 3-4 LinkedIn posts/week\\\\n- Format mix: Carousels, single images, short-form video, threads\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## First Open-Source AI Tool Recommendation\\\\n\\\\n**Recommended: Angular AI Component Generator**\\\\n- Uses AI to generate Angular components from descriptions\\\\n- Solves real pain point: developers spend hours creating boilerplate\\\\n- Leverages existing expertise: Angular + AI = unique positioning\\\\n- Differentiation: Most AI code generators focus on React; Angular is underserved\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 30-Day Content Calendar\\\\n\\\\n### Week 1: Foundation & Credibility (Days 1-7)\\\\n\\\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\\\n| 1 | I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey | Single post + thread |\\\\n| 2 | Tech tip: Angular signals deep dive | Carousel |\\\\n| 3 | Personal: Why I decided to go self-taught | Single post |\\\\n| 4 | Industry take: Angular vs React in 2026 | Single post |\\\\n| 5 | Open source announcement: My first AI tool coming | Single post |\\\\n| 6 | Buffer/Engagement day | - |\\\\n| 7 | Week recap + engagement | Single post |\\\\n\\\\n### Week 2: Technical Authority (Days 8-14)\\\\n\\\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\\\n| 8 | .NET + AI integration tutorial preview | Carousel |\\\\n| 9 | The one skill that changed my career | Sing... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n5:   \\\"baseRevisionId\\\": null\\n6: }\\n\\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"{\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Brand Strategy & Content Plan\\\",\\n  \\\"format\\\": \\\"markdown\\\",\\n  \\\"body\\\": \\\"# Self-Taught Labs - Brand Strategy & 30-Day Content Plan\\\\n\\\\n## Company Mission\\\\n**Self-Taught Labs** is a personal brand studio for a self-taught Senior Developer with 7+ years of experience in Angular/.NET who builds open-source AI tools.\\\\n\\\\n## Strategic Goals (Next 90 Days)\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 1: LinkedIn Growth\\\\n- Target: 500+ followers in 90 days\\\\n- Strategy: Position as expert Angular/.NET developer who self-taught AI/ML\\\\n- Content mix: 60% technical, 30% personal brand, 10% industry commentary\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 2: Open-Source AI Tool v1\\\\n- Target: Ship first open-source AI tool\\\\n- Tech stack: Angular + .NET + AI integration\\\\n- Focus: Solve a real problem for Angular/.NET developers\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 3: Content Production\\\\n- Target: 3-4 LinkedIn posts/week\\\\n- Format mix: Carousels, single images, short-form video, threads\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## First Open-Source AI Tool Recommendation\\\\n\\\\n**Recommended: Angular AI Component Generator**\\\\n- Uses AI to generate Angular components from descriptions\\\\n- Solves real pain point: developers spend hours creating boilerplate\\\\n- Leverages existing expertise: Angular + AI = unique positioning\\\\n- Differentiation: Most AI code generators focus on React; Angular is underserved\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 30-Day Content Calendar\\\\n\\\\n### Wee