74867312206,\"end\":1774867312206}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774867312355,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2c1adc4bdffevDEA9XKD5fmxad\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d3e55eee2001tbtfi8QSgYxRYy\",\"reason\":\"stop\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d3e55c903001Xa90D2p5jPhEtw\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2c1adc4bdffevDEA9XKD5fmxad\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":49789,\"input\":66,\"output\":353,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":1707,\"read\":47663}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n"}$paperclip$, NULL, $paperclip$ses_2c1adc4bdffevDEA9XKD5fmxad$paperclip$, $paperclip$local_file$paperclip$, $paperclip$c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0\aa1885fe-ea23-4708-9895-9c8c3fb11d4a.ndjson$paperclip$, $paperclip$170213$paperclip$, $paperclip$6080ed8c8b293f5246ecb2721ebf1d542f2f7aee310e8920b9d3c66eca1ea632$paperclip$, false, $paperclip$ap + milestone | Single post |\\n\\n### Week 4: Momentum \\u0026 Launch (Days 22-30)\\n\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\n| 22 | Progress update: 30 days in | Single post |\\n| 23 | Technical deep dive | Carousel |\\n| 24 | Tool launch prep | Single post |\\n| 25 | Launch day: AI Component Generator v1 | Announcement |\\n| 26 | Tutorial: How to use the tool | Carousel |\\n| 27 | Thank you post + lessons learned | Single post |\\n| 28 | Buffer | - |\\n| 29 | Month 1 recap + whats next | Single post |\\n| 30 | Highlight: Best performing post | Repost + insights |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## First LinkedIn Post Recommendation\\n\\n**Topic:** I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey\\n\\n**Why this works:**\\n1. Authentic personal story - differentiates from generic tech content\\n2. Self-taught angle - resonates with junior devs and career changers\\n3. Credibility anchor - first post sets the narrative\\n4. Emotional hook - vulnerability builds connection\\n\\n**Hook idea:**\\nAfter 7 years of Angular and .NET, I decided to self-teach AI. Everyone said I was too late. Here is what happened next...\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Execution Roadmap (Weekly Tasks)\\n\\n### Week 1-2: Foundation\\n- Set up LinkedIn personal profile optimized for personal brand\\n- Draft and schedule Week 1-2 content (14 posts)\\n- Research and validate AI tool idea\\n- Create GitHub repo for open-source project\\n\\n### Week 3-4: Build \\u0026 Launch\\n- Develop AI Component Generator v1\\n- Draft and schedule Week 3-4 content (14 posts)\\n- Prepare launch assets\\n- Execute launch campaign (Days 24-26)\\n\\n### Ongoing\\n- Monitor analytics weekly\\n- Iterate content strategy based on engagement\\n- Plan Month 2 content based on learnings\\n\",\r\n    \"latestRevisionId\":  \"91c5c27b-5cd0-44ea-8c5f-cc72700d5240\",\r\n    \"latestRevisionNumber\":  1,\r\n    \"createdByAgentId\":  \"6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0\",\r\n    \"createdByUserId\":  null,\r\n    \"updatedByAgentId\":  \"6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0\",\r\n    \"updatedByUserId\":  null,\r\n    \"createdAt\":  \"2026-03-30T10:40:49.244Z\",\r\n    \"updatedAt\":  \"2026-03-30T10:40:49.244Z\"\r\n}\r\n","metadata":{"output":"{\r\n    \"id\":  \"d6218aeb-fc2f-485a-9939-c17da0bcff5a\",\r\n    \"companyId\":  \"c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\",\r\n    \"issueId\":  \"7f1e6fda-f0fa-4407-98fd-e5c17eda8c60\",\r\n    \"key\":  \"plan\",\r\n    \"title\":  \"Brand Strategy \\u0026 Content Plan\",\r\n    \"format\":  \"markdown\",\r\n    \"body\":  \"# Self-Taught Labs - Brand Strategy \\u0026 30-Day Content Plan\\n\\n## Company Mission\\n**Self-Taught Labs** is a personal brand studio for a self-taught Senior Developer with 7+ years of experience in Angular/.NET who builds open-source AI tools.\\n\\n## Strategic Goals (Next 90 Days)\\n\\n### Goal 1: LinkedIn Growth\\n- Target: 500+ followers in 90 days\\n- Strategy: Position as expert Angular/.NET developer who self-taught AI/ML\\n- Content mix: 60% technical, 30% personal brand, 10% industry commentary\\n\\n### Goal 2: Open-Source AI Tool v1\\n- Target: Ship first open-source AI tool\\n- Tech stack: Angular + .NET + AI integration\\n- Focus: Solve a real problem for Angular/.NET developers\\n\\n### Goal 3: Content Production\\n- Target: 3-4 LinkedIn posts/week\\n- Format mix: Carousels, single images, short-form video, threads\\n\\n---\\n\\n## First Open-Source AI Tool Recommendation\\n\\n**Recommended: Angular AI Component Generator**\\n- Uses AI to generate Angular components from descriptions\\n- Solves real pain point: developers spend hours creating boilerplate\\n- Leverages existing expertise: Angular + AI = unique positioning\\n- Differentiation: Most AI code generators focus on React; Angular is underserved\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 30-Day Content Calendar\\n\\n### Week 1: Foundation \\u0026 Credibility (Days 1-7)\\n\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\n| 1 | I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey | Single post + thread |\\n| 2 | Tech tip: Angular signals deep dive | Carousel |\\n| 3 | Personal: Why I decided to go self-taught | Single post |\\n| 4 | Industry take: Angular vs React in 2026 | Single post |\\n| 5 | Open source announcement: My first AI tool coming | Single post |\\n| 6 | Buffer/Engagement day | - |\\n| 7 | Week recap + engagement | Single post |\\n\\n### Week 2: Technical Authority (Days 8-14)\\n\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\n| 8 | .NET + AI integration tutorial preview | Carousel |\\n| 9 | The one skill that changed my career | Single post |\\n| 10 | Angular performance tips thread | Thread |\\n| 11 | Tool sneak peek: AI Component Generator | Single post |\\n| 12 | Book/podcast recommendation | Single post |\\n| 13 | Buffer | - |\\n| 14 | Week 2 recap | Single post |\\n\\n### Week 3: Community Building (Days 15-21)\\n\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\n| 15 | Q\\u0026A: Ask me anything about self-teaching | Single post |\\n| 16 | Case study: How I built a small project | Carousel |\\n| 17 | Industry news + take | Single post |\\n| 18 | Behind the scenes: Building AI tool | Single post |\\n| 19 | Cold take: Why most devs fail at AI | Single post |\\n| 20 | Buffer | - |\\n| 21 | Week 3 recap + milestone | Single post |\\n\\n### Week 4: Momentum \\u0026 Launch (Days 22-30)\\n\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\n| 22 | Progress update: 30 days in | Single post |\\n| 23 | Technical deep dive | Carousel |\\n| 24 | Tool launch prep | Single post |\\n| 25 | Launch day: AI Component Generator v1 | Announcement |\\n| 26 | Tutorial: How to use the tool | Carousel |\\n| 27 | Thank you post + lessons learned | Single post |\\n| 28 | Buffer | - |\\n| 29 | Month 1 recap + whats next | Single post |\\n| 30 | Highlight: Best performing post | Repost + insights |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## First LinkedIn Post Recommendation\\n\\n**Topic:** I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey\\n\\n**Why this works:**\\n1. Authentic personal story - differentiates from generic tech content\\n2. Self-taught angle - resonates with junior devs and career changers\\n3. Credibility anchor - first post sets the narrative\\n4. Emotional hook - vulnerability builds connection\\n\\n**Hook idea:**\\nAfter 7 years of Angular and .NET, I decided to self-teach AI. Everyone said I was too late. Here is what happened next...\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Execution Roadmap (Weekly Tasks)\\n\\n### Week 1-2: Foundation\\n- Set up LinkedIn personal profile optimized for personal brand\\n- Draft and schedule Week 1-2 content (14 posts)\\n- Research and validate AI tool idea\\n- Create GitHub repo for open-source project\\n\\n### Week 3-4: Build \\u0026 Launch\\n- Develop AI Component Generator v1\\n- Draft and schedule Week 3-4 content (14 posts)\\n- Prepare launch assets\\n- Execute launch campaign (Days 24-26)\\n\\n### Ongoing\\n- Monitor analytics weekly\\n- Iterate content strategy based on engagement\\n- Plan Month 2 content based on learnings\\n\",\r\n    \"latestRevisionId\":  \"91c5c27b-5cd0-44ea-8c5f-cc72700d5240\",\r\n    \