late\\\\n- Leverages existing expertise: Angular + AI = unique positioning\\\\n- Differentiation: Most AI code generators focus on React; Angular is underserved\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 30-Day Content Calendar\\\\n\\\\n### Week 1: Foundation & Credibility (Days 1-7)\\\\n\\\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\\\n| 1 | I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey | Single post + thread |\\\\n| 2 | Tech tip: Angular signals deep dive | Carousel |\\\\n| 3 | Personal: Why I decided to go self-taught | Single post |\\\\n| 4 | Industry take: Angular vs React in 2026 | Single post |\\\\n| 5 | Open source announcement: My first AI tool coming | Single post |\\\\n| 6 | Buffer/Engagement day | - |\\\\n| 7 | Week recap + engagement | Single post |\\\\n\\\\n### Week 2: Technical Authority (Days 8-14)\\\\n\\\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\\\n| 8 | .NET + AI integration tutorial preview | Carousel |\\\\n| 9 | The one skill that changed my career | Sing... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n5:   \\\"baseRevisionId\\\": null\\n6: }\\n\\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"{\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Brand Strategy & Content Plan\\\",\\n  \\\"format\\\": \\\"markdown\\\",\\n  \\\"body\\\": \\\"# Self-Taught Labs - Brand Strategy & 30-Day Content Plan\\\\n\\\\n## Company Mission\\\\n**Self-Taught Labs** is a personal brand studio for a self-taught Senior Developer with 7+ years of experience in Angular/.NET who builds open-source AI tools.\\\\n\\\\n## Strategic Goals (Next 90 Days)\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 1: LinkedIn Growth\\\\n- Target: 500+ followers in 90 days\\\\n- Strategy: Position as expert Angular/.NET developer who self-taught AI/ML\\\\n- Content mix: 60% technical, 30% personal brand, 10% industry commentary\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 2: Open-Source AI Tool v1\\\\n- Target: Ship first open-source AI tool\\\\n- Tech stack: Angular + .NET + AI integration\\\\n- Focus: Solve a real problem for Angular/.NET developers\\\\n\\\\n### Goal 3: Content Production\\\\n- Target: 3-4 LinkedIn posts/week\\\\n- Format mix: Carousels, single images, short-form video, threads\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## First Open-Source AI Tool Recommendation\\\\n\\\\n**Recommended: Angular AI Component Generator**\\\\n- Uses AI to generate Angular components from descriptions\\\\n- Solves real pain point: developers spend hours creating boilerplate\\\\n- Leverages existing expertise: Angular + AI = unique positioning\\\\n- Differentiation: Most AI code generators focus on React; Angular is underserved\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 30-Day Content Calendar\\\\n\\\\n### Week 1: Foundation & Credibility (Days 1-7)\\\\n\\\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\\\n| 1 | I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey | Single post + thread |\\\\n| 2 | Tech tip: Angular signals deep dive | Carousel |\\\\n| 3 | Personal: Why I decided to go self-taught | Single post |\\\\n| 4 | Industry take: Angular vs React in 2026 | Single post |\\\\n| 5 | Open source announcement: My first AI tool coming | Single post |\\\\n| 6 | Buffer/Engagement day | - |\\\\n| 7 | Week recap + engagement | Single post |\\\\n\\\\n### Week 2: Technical Authority (Days 8-14)\\\\n\\\\n| Day | Topic | Format |\\\\n|-----|-------|--------|\\\\n| 8 | .NET + AI integration tutorial preview | Carousel |\\\\n| 9 | The one skill that changed my career | Sing... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n  \\\"baseRevisionId\\\": null\\n}\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[]},\"title\":\"Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\plan.json\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774942323596,\"end\":1774942323604}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774942323734,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42ce8412001cxCtSdBY9S5suv\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42ce7646001LL8Mj2QCLs8BgA\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":36018,\"input\":634,\"output\":280,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":35104}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774942330591,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42ce9ed9001oUtX3ly4IJtCP1\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42ce8416001yOghdjGmjmI5Fj\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774942332458,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42ce9edc001v2lTAT3hrkD6Mx\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42ce8416001yOghdjGmjmI5Fj\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"callID\":\"call_function_8p9youxcuob7_1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"content\":\"# LinkedIn Post - Day 2\\n\\n## Post Draft\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Angular Signals in 2026: Everything You Need to Know 🧵**\\n\\nIf you're still using `ngOnChanges` in 2026, this thread is for you.\\n\\nAngular Signals changed how we write Angular. Here's what actually matters:\\n\\n1/ **What are Signals?**\\nSignals are reactive primitives that hold values. When the value changes, everything that depends on it updates automatically.\\n\\n```typescript\\ncount = signal(0);\\n\\n// Reading\\ncount(); // → 0\\n\\n// Writing\\ncount.set(5);\\ncount.update(c => c + 1);\\n```\\n\\n2/ **Computed Signals**\\nDerived state that automatically updates when dependencies change:\\n\\n```typescript\\ndoubleCount = computed(() => count() * 2);\\n```\\n\\nNo more manual subscriptions. No more `ngOnDestroy`. Just pure reactivity.\\n\\n3/ **Effects for Side Effects**\\nRun code when signals change:\\n\\n```typescript\\neffect(() => {\\n  console.log(`Count is now: ${count()}`);\\n});\\n```\\n\\nPerfect for logging, analytics, or syncing with localStorage.\\n\\n4/ **The Real Benefit**\\nBefore Signals: manual change detection, subscription management, memory leaks.\\n\\nAfter Signals: Angular knows exactly what changed. Performance improves automatically.\\n\\n5/ **Migration Strategy**\\n- Start with new components using signals\\n- Use `toSignal()` to convert observables\\n- Keep `ngOnChanges` for `@Input()` but plan to migrate\\n- Signals + OnPush = 🚀\\n\\nThe learning curve is minimal. The performance gains are substantial.\\n\\nAre you already using signals in production? 👇\\n\\n---\\n\\n_#Angular #AngularSignals #WebDevelopment #TypeScript #Frontend #Angular16 #Signals #ReactiveProgramming_\\n\",\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\linkedin-post-day2.md\"},\"output\":\"Wrote file successfully.\",\"metadata\":{\"diagnostics\":{},\"filepath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\linkedin-post-day2.md\",\"exists\":false,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\linkedin-post-day2.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774942330589,\"end\":1774942332449}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774942332458,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42cea623001nbNgQ020vcgYQM\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42ce8416001yOghdjGmjmI5Fj\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":37035,\"input\":805,\"output\":518,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":35712}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774942335479,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd32a7bfffePYj0iKYP14thcR\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42ceb1f10013UXgJ5RstwtHmv\",\"messageID\":\"