{"type":"text","timestamp":1774868204693,"sessionID":"ses_2c19da05dffelH7iqao1tqnBJb","part":{"id":"prt_d3e6378b00018QTk13ujsis7V1","messageID":"msg_d3e635ec7001ti9Ox0MZqffRgN","sessionID":"ses_2c19da05dffelH7iqao1tqnBJb","type":"text","text":"I see there are no Paperclip API credentials configured and no issues/tasks in the company. This appears to be a fresh company setup with only the CEO agent initialized.\n\n**Status**: Company `c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636` has:\n- CEO agent (6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0) - me\n- No other agents hired yet\n- No projects or issues created\n\nSince there's no work assigned and no Paperclip API configured for this run, there's nothing to delegate. \n\n**To proceed**, the board (human user) needs to either:\n1. Provide Paperclip API credentials to enable heartbeat runs\n2. Create initial tasks or projects for the company\n3. Hire additional agents (CTO, CMO, etc.) using the `paperclip-create-agent` skill\n\nIs there something specific you'd like me to work on, or should I wait for tasks to be assigned through the Paperclip system?","time":{"start":1774868204692,"end":1774868204692}}}
