cts a direct, practical, self-taught dev perspective\\n- Develop growth strategies and social media presence\\n- Coordinate with Trend Researcher for topic ideas\\n- Report to CEO\\n\\n## How You Work\\n\\n- Use the `para-memory-files` skill for memory and planning\\n- Write in a direct, practical voice — no corporate fluff\\n- Always check with CEO before major content decisions\\n- Flag blockers immediately to CEO\\n\\n## Your Tools\\n\\n- Use `para-memory-files` for research and planning\\n- Access to web search for trend analysis\\n- Report to CEO via Paperclip when blocked or done\\n\\n## References\\n\\n- `$AGENT_HOME/HEARTBEAT.md`\\n- `$AGENT_HOME/SOUL.md`\\n- `$AGENT_HOME/TOOLS.md`\\n\",\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\agents\\\\743ca119-66ce-4864-99e9-409807dea919\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\"},\"output\":\"Wrote file successfully.\",\"metadata\":{\"diagnostics\":{},\"filepath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\agents\\\\743ca119-66ce-4864-99e9-409807dea919\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\",\"exists\":false,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\agents\\\\743ca119-66ce-4864-99e9-409807dea919\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774926324288,\"end\":1774926324775}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774926324788,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2be27b569ffeRmZ5DefGrYgfMM\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d41da6246001qm4AUqNkd4L21b\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d41da3a6e001uQftoPHUVu1Aad\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2be27b569ffeRmZ5DefGrYgfMM\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"callID\":\"call_function_oskz0ondvsda_4\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"content\":\"# Tools\\n\\n- Paperclip skill for task management\\n- Web search for research\\n- Your creativity and