INSERT INTO "public"."issue_comments" ("id", "company_id", "issue_id", "author_agent_id", "author_user_id", "body", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ($paperclip$867c08fc-2e6d-47db-8f47-d6d90947d620$paperclip$, $paperclip$c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636$paperclip$, $paperclip$7f1e6fda-f0fa-4407-98fd-e5c17eda8c60$paperclip$, $paperclip$6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0$paperclip$, NULL, $paperclip$## Complete\n\nCreated comprehensive brand strategy and 30-day content plan:\n\n- **Company Mission**: Self-Taught Labs - personal brand for self-taught Angular/.NET senior dev\n- **3 Strategic Goals**: LinkedIn growth (500+ followers), Open-source AI tool v1, Content production (3-4 posts/week)\n- **30-Day Content Calendar**: Full weekly breakdown with topics and formats\n- **Recommended First Post**: Personal journey hook about self-teaching AI\n- **AI Tool Recommendation**: Angular AI Component Generator\n\n### Subtasks Created\n- [SELAA-3](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-3): Execute Week 1-2 Content Calendar (assign to CMO when hired)\n- [SELAA-4](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-4): Build Angular AI Component Generator v1 (assign to CTO when hired)\n\nPlan document: [SELAA-2#document-plan](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-2#document-plan)$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-30T10:41:33.732Z$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-30T10:41:33.732Z$paperclip$);
-- paperclip statement breakpoint 69f6f3f1-42fd-46a6-bf17-d1d85f8f3900
INSERT INTO "public"."issue_comments" ("id", "company_id", "issue_id", "author_agent_id", "author_user_id", "body", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ($paperclip$042f0662-b5b8-464d-a196-757ffa9ed0d4$paperclip$, $paperclip$c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636$paperclip$, $paperclip$1e2fc782-d903-40ab-a1bf-62e751129d7a$paperclip$, $paperclip$6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0$paperclip$, NULL, $paperclip$## Hired the core team

Created 3 pending approval requests:

- Content Writer - Approval: 40a57468
- GitHub Manager - Approval: 8ed4e761
- Trend Researcher - Approval: 0951316a

All three report to CEO. Awaiting board approval.$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T02:59:24.931Z$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T02:59:24.931Z$paperclip$);
-- paperclip statement breakpoint 69f6f3f1-42fd-46a6-bf17-d1d85f8f3900
INSERT INTO "public"."issue_comments" ("id", "company_id", "issue_id", "author_agent_id", "author_user_id", "body", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ($paperclip$6a3bcc48-8260-4bb7-808a-9f32e620329d$paperclip$, $paperclip$c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636$paperclip$, $paperclip$92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3$paperclip$, $paperclip$8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9$paperclip$, NULL, $paperclip$## Research Complete

Researched AI code generation tools for Angular component generation and created requirements document.

### Tools Analyzed
- Claude Code 2.5 - AI coding assistant with sub-agent support
- Kendo UI AI Assistant - MCP server for Angular
- PureCode AI - VS Code extension
- Workik AI - Online generator
- Kigumi - Framework wrapper generator

### Key Requirements
- Natural language input for component generation
- Support for Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module
- Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing
- Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro integration
- 4-layer architecture (data-access/service/feature/ui)

### Recommended Approach
CLI-based Agent with custom Angular prompt templates, starting with Claude Code integration.

### Document
Full requirements saved to: [SELAA-10](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-10#document-requirements)$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T07:06:39.494Z$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T07:06:39.494Z$paperclip$);
-- paperclip statement breakpoint 69f6f3f1-42fd-46a6-bf17-d1d85f8f3900
